From: PortareOS <hello@portare.org>
Subject: [PATCH] libretro: fall back to the image's game patch archive

A real resources directory under RetroArch's system directory can hide
the link to the image's resources. Try the shipped archive when opening
the system directory's archive fails.
---
diff --git a/pcsx2/Patch.cpp b/pcsx2/Patch.cpp
index 2c2cef5..abc86a3 100644
--- a/pcsx2/Patch.cpp
+++ b/pcsx2/Patch.cpp
@@ -326,6 +326,10 @@ bool Patch::OpenPatchesZip()
 #endif
 	}
 
+	// A resources directory on writable storage can shadow the image's symlink.
+	if (!s_patches_zip)
+		s_patches_zip = zip_open("/usr/share/armsx2/resources/patches.zip", ZIP_RDONLY, nullptr);
+
 	if (!s_patches_zip)
 	{
 		static bool warning_shown = false;
